**Target Audience:** Master Coder
**Objective:** Implement deterministic composite line IDs to resolve cart collisions, quantity merging errors, and React key duplication.
**Constraint:** Zero ambiguity. Copy/paste compatible. No exploration needed.

---

## 1. EXACT FILE TARGETS & CREATION LIST

| Action | File Path | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **CREATE** | `src/utils/cartUtils.js` | **Single source of truth** for `buildLineSignature`, `buildLineId`. Exported for unit testing. |
| **MODIFY** | `src/context/CartContext.jsx` (or `src/reducers/cartReducer.js`) | Cart state logic: `addItem`, `removeItem`, `updateQuantity` **MUST** use `lineId` (composite) as primary key. |
| **MODIFY** | `src/components/POS.jsx` (or `src/pages/POS.jsx`) | UI: Pass full `item` config to `addItem`. Render cart lines keyed by `line.lineId`. |
| **CREATE** | `src/utils/__tests__/cartUtils.test.js` | Unit tests for deterministic ID generation. |
| **CREATE** | `src/context/__tests__/CartContext.test.jsx` | Integration tests for collision/merge logic. |

> **Assumption:** Project uses React Context + `useReducer` for Cart state (standard for POS). If using Redux Toolkit, apply same logic to `cartSlice.js`.

---

## 2. DATA MODELS & TYPES (JSDoc / TypeScript Interfaces)

**Enforce these shapes in your implementation.** The `item` object passed to `addItem` **MUST** contain these fields.

