## 4. CART REDUCER / CONTEXT LOGIC MODIFICATIONS

**File:** `src/context/CartContext.jsx` (or `src/reducers/cartReducer.js`)

**Core Principle:** State is a **Map/Object keyed by `lineId` (Composite)**, NOT `item.id`.

```javascript
